[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0010","text":"────１、２、３、４……\n哒、哒、哒────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0020","text":"──────……\n…………不对────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0030","text":"１、２────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0040","text":"辛苦了，美琴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0050","text":"────辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0060","text":"想着给你带点喝的……\n抱歉，打扰到你了吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0070","text":"……没有\n正好，卡住了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0080","text":"谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0090","text":"是吗，是舞蹈动作啊\n……在我看来已经编排得很完美了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_01_0100","text":"────哈哈，嗯……\n如果你能慢慢钻研到满意为止，我会很开心的"}]
